        "dose": "standard"
      },
      "justification": "Calcium chloride addresses reversible causes of cardiac arrest including hyperkalemia and hypocalcemia (part of the H's and T's evaluation already initiated), and may be indicated based on reversible cause evaluation."
    },
    {
